        <li pn="section-5-6.2">Parameter Description: The public key</li>
        <li pn="section-5-6.3">Parameter Information Class: Public</li>
        <li pn="section-5-6.4">Used with &quot;kty&quot; Value(s): &quot;OKP&quot;</li>
        <li pn="section-5-6.5">Change Controller: IESG</li>
        <li pn="section-5-6.6">Specification Document(s): Section 2 of RFC 8037</li>
      </ul>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-5-7">「JSON Web Signature and Encryption Algorithms」レジストリーに、次のものが追加されました。</t>
