        <li pn="section-5-8.5">Change Controller: IESG</li>
        <li pn="section-5-8.6">Specification Document(s): Section 3.1 of RFC 8037</li>
        <li pn="section-5-8.7">Algorithm Analysis Documents(s): <xref target="RFC8032" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC8032"/></li>
      </ul>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-5-9">「JSON Web Key Elliptic Curve」レジストリーに、次のものが追加されました。</t>
      <ul bare="false" empty="false" indent="3" spacing="normal" pn="section-5-10">
        <li pn="section-5-10.1">Curve Name: &quot;Ed25519&quot;</li>
        <li pn="section-5-10.2">Curve Description: Ed25519 signature algorithm key pairs</li>
